#### 4. Mystery Guest — `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 140)

The test reads from a hard-coded file path (`C:\TestData\orders.csv`) making it dependent on an external resource that may not exist on other machines.

```csharp
// ❌ Smell
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```

**Fix** — use an inline string literal or embedded resource:

```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    const string csv = """
        SKU-1,2,49.99
        SKU-2,1,19.99
        SKU-3,3,12.00
        SKU-4,1,75.00
        SKU-5,2,30.00
        """;

    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csv);

    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
