**Risk if unfixed:** Test always fails on CI and on any machine without that exact path — effectively dead code.

> **Note:** This test also exhibits the extended catalog smell **Resource Optimism** (assumes `C:\TestData\orders.csv` exists without guarding). The fix above resolves both smells.

